{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Chaussivert": 3,
    "Choiseul": 7,
    "Fusilier": 5,
    "Lemarcq": 1,
    "Paimon": 3,
    "Player": 8,
    "Raimondo": 17
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7413612",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741361201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741361201": {
            "id": "741361201",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "Any questions? Honorary Senior Researcher?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361203",
              "741361209",
              "741361221"
            ]
          },
          "741361203": {
            "id": "741361203",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "They will temporarily stay at the Fortress of Meropide where they will repent for their misconduct.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361204"
            ]
          },
          "741361204": {
            "id": "741361204",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "That said, the Edwin I know doesn't do \"repent.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361205"
            ]
          },
          "741361205": {
            "id": "741361205",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "No matter, as long as Edwin is kept away from research equipment and Arkhium.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361206"
            ]
          },
          "741361206": {
            "id": "741361206",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "As for Nacker... I don't believe he'll cause more trouble for us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361207"
            ]
          },
          "741361207": {
            "id": "741361207",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "I... I can only hope I don't run into situations that would require their expertise..."
          },
          "741361209": {
            "id": "741361209",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "...Edwin Eastinghouse is a genius. People in the same field either gave up on themselves or became his followers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361210"
            ]
          },
          "741361210": {
            "id": "741361210",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "Miss Fusilier is a very passionate and creative researcher, often achieving great results with minimal resources.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361211"
            ]
          },
          "741361211": {
            "id": "741361211",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "After joining the Tech Sect III of the Arkhium Research Project, she was put in charge of the structural design of the suppressor and had frequent run-ins with Edwin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361212"
            ]
          },
          "741361212": {
            "id": "741361212",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "Maybe that's when she started idolizing Edwin. Just like the other followers, Edwin's approval became her only pursuit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361213"
            ]
          },
          "741361213": {
            "id": "741361213",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "After the explosion, she refused to believe that Edwin was the one who caused it, so she applied to join the investigation in an attempt to clear Edwin's name.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361214"
            ]
          },
          "741361214": {
            "id": "741361214",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "Now that you've dealt with Edwin, what do you make of him?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361215"
            ]
          },
          "741361215": {
            "id": "741361215",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A freak of nature who cares only for his research! He always tries to push the blame to others, and he can't even remember Miss Fusilier's name!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361216"
            ]
          },
          "741361216": {
            "id": "741361216",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "That sounds like him, all right. Other than his research, there's rarely anything that's worth a second of his attention.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361217"
            ]
          },
          "741361217": {
            "id": "741361217",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "And he cares for nothing else as long as his research runs smoothly. Not even when his own subordinates stole the Institute's assets to sell.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361218"
            ]
          },
          "741361218": {
            "id": "741361218",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "I only approved Fusilier's application to join the investigation... so she would come to realize she was chasing an image of him she fabricated.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361219"
            ]
          },
          "741361219": {
            "id": "741361219",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "Now that image has finally been shattered, I can only hope she picks herself up soon... The Fontaine Research Institute cannot afford to lose more of its people."
          },
          "741361221": {
            "id": "741361221",
            "speakerId": 5257,
            "speakerName": "Raimondo",
            "text": "Goodbye, Honorary Senior Researcher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7413613",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741361301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741361301": {
            "id": "741361301",
            "speakerId": 5258,
            "speakerName": "Choiseul",
            "text": "Phew... It's okay. It's okay. The nightmare is over.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361303",
              "741361306",
              "741361310"
            ]
          },
          "741361303": {
            "id": "741361303",
            "speakerId": 5258,
            "speakerName": "Choiseul",
            "text": "Whoa! You scared me! How I feel? Nothing, to be honest. I only hope that irresponsible scoundrel pays for what he's done!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361304"
            ]
          },
          "741361304": {
            "id": "741361304",
            "speakerId": 5258,
            "speakerName": "Choiseul",
            "text": "Personally, I'd tie his hands and legs up and blindfold him to stop him from getting his hands on Arkhium if I could!"
          },
          "741361306": {
            "id": "741361306",
            "speakerId": 5258,
            "speakerName": "Choiseul",
            "text": "A bit more relieved, yes, compared to before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361307"
            ]
          },
          "741361307": {
            "id": "741361307",
            "speakerId": 5258,
            "speakerName": "Choiseul",
            "text": "But, to be honest, locking Nacker and Edwin up together? Gosh! I can't even imagine what those two would be up to!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361308"
            ]
          },
          "741361308": {
            "id": "741361308",
            "speakerId": 5258,
            "speakerName": "Choiseul",
            "text": "Explosion has been past and done. So what's next? Flooding the entire Fontaine with Fonta? I can't even imagine..."
          },
          "741361310": {
            "id": "741361310",
            "speakerId": 5258,
            "speakerName": "Choiseul",
            "text": "You too, Honorary Senior Researcher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7413614",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741361401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741361401": {
            "id": "741361401",
            "speakerId": 21353,
            "speakerName": "Fusilier",
            "text": "No value... My research has no value...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361402"
            ]
          },
          "741361402": {
            "id": "741361402",
            "speakerId": 21352,
            "speakerName": "Lemarcq",
            "text": "Miss, please don't think that way. Your invention saved my life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361403"
            ]
          },
          "741361403": {
            "id": "741361403",
            "speakerId": 21353,
            "speakerName": "Fusilier",
            "text": "But... But... Mr. Edwin... *whimper* *sob* Edwin said this thing is worthless...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361404"
            ]
          },
          "741361404": {
            "id": "741361404",
            "speakerId": 21351,
            "speakerName": "Chaussivert",
            "text": "That just means that that Edwin's blind! This thing is a treasure! Worthless? Ha! I'd give an arm to have one for each of my men!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361405"
            ]
          },
          "741361405": {
            "id": "741361405",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Edwin's a bad person. He's full of baloney.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361406"
            ]
          },
          "741361406": {
            "id": "741361406",
            "speakerId": 21353,
            "speakerName": "Fusilier",
            "text": "Mr. Edwin is not a bad person! He... He... Anyway... He can't even remember my name! I even showed him my designs so many times...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361407"
            ]
          },
          "741361407": {
            "id": "741361407",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Miss Fusilier, you are very talented! Why do you let that Edwin guy judge your worth?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361408"
            ]
          },
          "741361408": {
            "id": "741361408",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "He doesn't see what I see in you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361409"
            ]
          },
          "741361409": {
            "id": "741361409",
            "speakerId": 21353,
            "speakerName": "Fusilier",
            "text": "R—Really?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361410"
            ]
          },
          "741361410": {
            "id": "741361410",
            "speakerId": 21351,
            "speakerName": "Chaussivert",
            "text": "Of course. Take it from all of us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361411"
            ]
          },
          "741361411": {
            "id": "741361411",
            "speakerId": 21353,
            "speakerName": "Fusilier",
            "text": "But... you don't know research... *sobs*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361412"
            ]
          },
          "741361412": {
            "id": "741361412",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Miss Fusilier... she's no longer coherent. I think we better leave her alone for a bit...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741361413"
            ]
          },
          "741361413": {
            "id": "741361413",
            "speakerId": 21351,
            "speakerName": "Chaussivert",
            "text": "Okay... Lemarcq and I will be right here. Call us if you need anything."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}